From: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: restart the NPU on a full chip reset

mt7996_mac_full_reset()/mt7996_mac_restart() skip stopping/re-initing the NPU
and run napi_disable() on unregistered NPU RRO/txfree queues (NULL ->dev).
Mirror L1 SER: stop the NPU before reset, skip NPU queues in both NAPI loops,
and re-run __mt7996_npu_hw_init() on restart.

[xr1710g: refresh hunk context for mt76 acb7b1c8 so patch applies with fuzz=0]

Origin: https://github.com/Gilly1970/Gemtek-W1700K-6.18
Signed-off-by: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: genshanxinli <127909456+genshanxinli@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/mt7996/mac.c b/mt7996/mac.c
index dc2a745..a912cd1 100644
--- a/mt7996/mac.c
+++ b/mt7996/mac.c
@@ -2260,6 +2260,13 @@ mt7996_mac_restart(struct mt7996_dev *dev)
 		    mt76_queue_is_wed_rro(&mdev->q_rx[i]))
 			continue;
 
+		if (mt76_npu_device_active(mdev) &&
+		    mt76_queue_is_wed_rro(&mdev->q_rx[i]))
+			continue;
+
+		if (mt76_queue_is_npu_txfree(&mdev->q_rx[i]))
+			continue;
+
 		if (mdev->q_rx[i].ndesc)
 			napi_disable(&dev->mt76.napi[i]);
 	}
@@ -2276,6 +2283,13 @@ mt7996_mac_restart(struct mt7996_dev *dev)
 		    mt76_queue_is_wed_rro(&mdev->q_rx[i]))
 			continue;
 
+		if (mt76_npu_device_active(mdev) &&
+		    mt76_queue_is_wed_rro(&mdev->q_rx[i]))
+			continue;
+
+		if (mt76_queue_is_npu_txfree(&mdev->q_rx[i]))
+			continue;
+
 		if (mdev->q_rx[i].ndesc) {
 			napi_enable(&dev->mt76.napi[i]);
 			local_bh_disable();
@@ -2329,6 +2343,13 @@ mt7996_mac_restart(struct mt7996_dev *dev)
 				     MT_INT_TX_RX_DONE_EXT);
 	}
 
+	/* Re-init NPU with recreated rings; fail restart on error so full reset retries. */
+	ret = __mt7996_npu_hw_init(dev);
+	if (ret) {
+		dev_err(mdev->dev, "NPU re-init after full reset failed: %d\n", ret);
+		goto out;
+	}
+
 	/* set the necessary init items */
 	ret = mt7996_mcu_set_eeprom(dev);
 	if (ret)
@@ -2438,6 +2459,8 @@ mt7996_mac_full_reset(struct mt7996_dev *dev)
 
 	dev->recovery.hw_full_reset = true;
 
+	mt7996_npu_hw_stop(dev);
+
 	set_bit(MT76_RESTART, &dev->mphy.state);
 	set_bit(MT76_MCU_RESET, &dev->mphy.state);
 	wake_up(&dev->mt76.mcu.wait);
